  "General adult screening reference, not a diagnosis. These ranges do not apply directly to children or pregnancy. Muscle mass and older age also affect interpretation.": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "General adult screening reference, not a diagnosis. These ranges do not apply directly to children or pregnancy. Muscle mass and older age also affect interpretation."
