    "Also updates importance and all generated open successors, replacing their individual template edits. Completed and canceled successors keep their history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Also updates importance and all generated open successors, replacing their individual template edits. Completed and canceled successors keep their history."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时更新重要标记和已生成的未完成后继，覆盖它们单独修改的模板字段。已完成及已取消的后继保留历史。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Repeating reminders keep their calendar-day offset from the fixed anchor, using the planned day first, otherwise the deadline. The supported range is 366 days before or after.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Repeating reminders keep their calendar-day offset from the fixed anchor, using the planned day first, otherwise the deadline. The supported range is 366 days before or after."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重复提醒保留相对固定锚点的日历日期偏移；锚点优先取原计划日，否则取原截止日。支持前后366天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Normal writes are paused. Export the retained database and original files for recovery. This private archive needs support recovery and cannot be imported as a normal backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Normal writes are paused. Export the retained database and original files for recovery. This private archive needs support recovery and cannot be imported as a normal backup."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正常写入已暂停。可导出保留的数据库与原始文件用于恢复。此私有包需要支持恢复，不能作为普通备份导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
